    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Player passed in postcombat main with Torch Fiend as the only castable spell and no instant-speed plays available. With only 2 lands on turn 9 and no creatures on board, deploying a 2/1 body is strictly better than doing nothing. There are no spells to hold up mana for (Tragic Lesson costs 3, Bury in Books costs 5).",
      "action_taken": "Passed priority, ending the turn with 2 untapped lands and no board presence.",
