    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Cast Elite Instructor before playing their Mountain land drop. Playing the Mountain first would give 4 lands on board, allowing Elite Instructor to be cast with 1 red mana still available afterward. This extra mana could matter if the draw from Elite Instructor reveals something castable for R, and there's no benefit to holding the land drop.",
