      "decision_index": 33,
    },
    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Discarded the only land in hand while at only 3 lands on the battlefield with a hand full of 4-5 mana spells (Biblioplex Kraken, Havoc Jester, Tolarian Sentinel, Traitorous Greed). This means no land drop this turn and being stuck at 3 mana with no way to cast anything meaningful.",
