    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Chose to discard a card from Tragic Lesson instead of bouncing a tapped land back to hand. Bouncing a tapped land (like the tapped Island or Mountain) costs almost nothing since they already have 2 Islands in hand for future land drops, while discarding loses an actual card.",
