      "severity": "major",
      "description": "Timed out and passed the postcombat main phase with 4 untapped lands and multiple castable spells (Furnace Whelp, Ignite the Future, Spellgorger Weird) while at 10 life facing a 5/5 Havoc Jester and other threats. Doing nothing here wastes an entire turn of development when desperately needing board presence.",
