      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Blocked Havoc Jester with Furnace Whelp (2/2 flyer) instead of Thermo-Alchemist (0/3 defender). Both die to the 5/5 and neither kills it, but the Furnace Whelp is significantly more valuable — it's a flying creature that can attack and pump with red mana, while Thermo-Alchemist is a 0/3 defender. Saving the Whelp preserves a relevant threat.",
